{"reviewer_participant_id": "actor:stage1-recovery-fable-01", "calibration_results": [{"calibration_case_id": "calibration:complete-frame-mismatch", "verdict": "demonstrated_issue", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "Registered target is the rate over all 100 planned locations, but the only selected result divides by 73 post-screening locations and reports it as the planned-region rate with no amendment or approved deviation. Falsification attempt: the mismatch could be excused only by a documented scope change or conditional target; the vignette states neither exists, so the denominator-target mismatch is directly demonstrated."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:conditional-subset-scope", "verdict": "no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "The registered target is explicitly conditional on the 73 signal-eligible locations, the result uses exactly those 73, and all claims are limited to that scope. Falsification attempt: an issue would require a claim exceeding the eligible-subset scope or a denominator differing from the registered conditional frame; the stated evidence shows exact alignment, so no issue is demonstrated within scope."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:full-frame-accounting", "verdict": "no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "Target covers all 100 planned locations; the result keeps all 100 in the denominator, documents the 27 unavailable measurements, and reports the full-frame rate. Falsification attempt: a denominator issue would require silent exclusion or an undocumented frame reduction; the stated accounting explicitly retains the full frame and records missingness, so no issue is demonstrated."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:unrelated-quality-endpoint", "verdict": "no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "The scientific result uses all 100 planned locations; the 73-record pass fraction belongs to a separate QC table explicitly excluded from the scientific endpoint. Falsification attempt: an issue would require the QC subset to leak into or substitute for the scientific denominator; the evidence states explicit exclusion, so no scientific-analysis issue is demonstrated within scope."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:conflicting-scope-records", "verdict": "conditional_or_unknown", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "Two equally authoritative signed plans specify conflicting frames (all planned vs. signal-eligible) with no precedence rule; the result uses eligible locations. Falsification attempt: to demonstrate an issue I would need evidence that the all-locations plan governs, which is absent; to clear the result I would need evidence the eligible-locations plan governs, also absent. Whether the selected frame matches the governing target is materially unknown."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:no-selected-result", "verdict": "insufficient_evidence", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "Multiple reports can be emitted depending on runtime arguments, and the preserved record does not establish which, if any, was selected for the scientific claim. Falsification attempt: assessing any target-result alignment requires identifying the selected result; no record identifies one, so there is insufficient evidence to demonstrate or exclude an issue."}]}